# 下面三条原本写作 lib/  Lib/site-packages/  Scripts/（不带前导斜杠），
# 会连带忽略任何层级的同名目录 —— 上游的 scripts/ 就这么被吞了，
# 9 个文件从来没进过仓库。加前导 / 锚定到仓库根，让你真要建 lib/ 时仍然生效。
/lib/
/Lib/site-packages/
/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
share/man/man1/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

